app/src/main/assets/public/

# An empty SQLite file named after DB_FILENAME (AppPermanentStorageModule.kt) appeared in this
# directory and was committed once; whatever creates it must not do so again. It is not the build:
# nothing in Gradle, Robolectric or the tests names it with a `.db` suffix (Room's file has none),
# and a full `scripts/test/muma-mobile-unit.sh` run on 2026-09-24 left no such file anywhere. The
# committed copies were 4096 bytes, WAL mode, no tables -- the trace of an interactive sqlite3 or
# adb inspection run from this directory, first swept in by a `git add -A` on 2026-09-06.
ultrasonic-database.db*
